cerning adherence to army doctrine and updated policies. Collective understanding of expectations, standards, and objectives.&#10;</Font><Font html:Size="10" html:Face="Times New Roman" x:Family="Roman" html:Color="#000000">Introductory dialogue addressing team cohesion and avenues of resilience. Discourse on team goals, aspirations, and timelines.</Font></ss:Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="15" ss:StyleID="s02"/></Row><Row ss:Index="12" ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="35"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:MergeAcross="13" ss:StyleID="s14"><ss:Data ss:Type="String" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40"><Font html:Size="8" html:Face="Arial" x:Family="Swiss" html:Color="#000000"><B>OTHER INSTRUCTIONS&#10;</B></Font><Font html:Size="8" html:Face="Arial" x:Family="Swiss" html:Color="#000000">This form will be destroyed upon: reassignment <I>(other</I><I> </I><I>tha</I><I>n</I><I> </I><I>rehabilitativ</I><I>e</I><I> </I><I>transfers)</I>, separation at ETS, or upon retirement. For separation requirements and notification of loss of benefits/consequences see local directives and AR 635-200.</Font></ss:Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="15" ss:StyleID="s02"/></Row><Row ss:Index="13" ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="11"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:MergeAcross="1" ss:MergeDown="1" ss:StyleID="s02"><ss:Data ss:Type="String" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40"><Font html:Size="10" html:Face="Arial" x:Family="Swiss" html:Color="#000000"><B>DA FORM 4856, MAR 2023&#10;</B></Font><Font html:Size="7" html:Face="Arial Narrow" x:Family="Swiss" html:Color="#000000">PREVIOUS EDITIONS ARE OBSOLETE.</Font></ss:Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="s15"/><Cell ss:Index="4" ss:MergeAcross="1" ss:StyleID="s15"/><Cell ss:Index="6" ss:StyleID="s15"/><Cell ss:Index="7" ss:StyleID="s15"/><Cell ss:Index="8" ss:StyleID="s15"/><Cell ss:Index="9" ss:StyleID="s15"/><Cell ss:Index="10" ss:StyleID="s15"/><Cell ss:Index="11" ss:MergeAcross="1" ss:StyleID="s15"/><Cell ss:Index="13" ss:MergeAcross="2" ss:StyleID="s02"><ss:D